{
  "title": "BandIt band radio and photos",
  "description": "Every packet the venue gateway heard from the bands and the station markers, and every photo's record, as the venue laptop's recorders wrote them. Kept for after the event; nothing live reads them.",
  "time_range": {
    "from": "2026-10-01T00:00:00.000Z",
    "to": "now+1d"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 16,
        "h": 11
      },
      "type": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "content": "## Band radio and photos\n\nThe recorders on the venue laptop write every line the gateway hears, with an id from its content, so a second upload adds nothing.\n\n- `bandit-raw-radio`: each beacon from a band or a station marker, with its zone and its SOS, fall and button flags\n- `bandit-raw-heard`: each band's list of the bands and station markers it heard, with their signal strength\n- `bandit-raw-photos`: each photo's camera, time and place, never the image\n\nKept for after the event. The live screen reads SpacetimeDB, never these."
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 11
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "metric",
        "title": "Beacons heard",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-raw-radio | STATS beacons = COUNT()"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "beacons"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 11
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "metric",
        "title": "Bands heard",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-raw-radio | WHERE kind == \"band\" | STATS bands = COUNT_DISTINCT(id)"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "bands"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 32,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 11
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "metric",
        "title": "Heard lists from the bands",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-raw-heard | STATS lists = COUNT()"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "lists"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 40,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 8,
        "h": 11
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "metric",
        "title": "Photos recorded",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-raw-photos | STATS photos = COUNT()"
        },
        "metrics": [
          {
            "type": "primary",
            "column": "photos"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 11,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "xy",
        "title": "Beacons every 10 seconds, from bands and station markers",
        "layers": [
          {
            "type": "bar_stacked",
            "data_source": {
              "type": "esql",
              "query": "FROM bandit-raw-radio | STATS beacons = COUNT() BY time = BUCKET(@timestamp, 10 seconds), kind | SORT time"
            },
            "x": {
              "column": "time"
            },
            "y": [
              {
                "column": "beacons"
              }
            ],
            "breakdown_by": {
              "column": "kind"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "data_table",
        "title": "Each band and station marker: beacons and signal at the gateway (dBm)",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-raw-radio | STATS beacons = COUNT(), signal = ROUND(AVG(rssi_gateway), 1) BY kind, id | SORT kind, id"
        },
        "rows": [
          {
            "column": "kind"
          },
          {
            "column": "id"
          }
        ],
        "metrics": [
          {
            "column": "beacons"
          },
          {
            "column": "signal"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 25,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "xy",
        "title": "Band beacons by zone",
        "layers": [
          {
            "type": "bar_horizontal",
            "data_source": {
              "type": "esql",
              "query": "FROM bandit-raw-radio | WHERE kind == \"band\" AND zone IS NOT NULL | EVAL zone = TO_STRING(zone) | STATS beacons = COUNT() BY zone | SORT beacons DESC"
            },
            "x": {
              "column": "zone"
            },
            "y": [
              {
                "column": "beacons"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 39,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "xy",
        "title": "Band beacons by flag: SOS, fall, button press",
        "layers": [
          {
            "type": "bar_horizontal",
            "data_source": {
              "type": "esql",
              "query": "FROM bandit-raw-radio | WHERE kind == \"band\" | EVAL flag = CASE(sos, \"SOS\", fall, \"fall\", pressed, \"button press\", \"none\") | STATS beacons = COUNT() BY flag | SORT beacons DESC"
            },
            "x": {
              "column": "flag"
            },
            "y": [
              {
                "column": "beacons"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 24,
        "y": 39,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 12
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "data_table",
        "title": "Heard lists per band",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-raw-heard | STATS lists = COUNT(), signal = ROUND(AVG(rssi_gateway), 1) BY band = id | SORT band"
        },
        "rows": [
          {
            "column": "band"
          }
        ],
        "metrics": [
          {
            "column": "lists"
          },
          {
            "column": "signal"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 51,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 12
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "data_table",
        "title": "Recording sessions",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-raw-radio, bandit-raw-heard, bandit-raw-gateway, bandit-raw-photos METADATA _index | STATS records = COUNT(), started = MIN(@timestamp), ended = MAX(@timestamp) BY session, index = _index | SORT started, index"
        },
        "rows": [
          {
            "column": "session"
          },
          {
            "column": "index"
          },
          {
            "column": "started"
          },
          {
            "column": "ended"
          }
        ],
        "metrics": [
          {
            "column": "records"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "grid": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 63,
        "w": 48,
        "h": 14
      },
      "type": "vis",
      "config": {
        "type": "data_table",
        "title": "Photo records",
        "data_source": {
          "type": "esql",
          "query": "FROM bandit-raw-photos | EVAL camera = CONCAT(COALESCE(make, \"\"), \" \", COALESCE(model, \"\")) | STATS photos = COUNT() BY taken = @timestamp, file, camera, source, session | SORT taken DESC | LIMIT 200"
        },
        "rows": [
          {
            "column": "taken"
          },
          {
            "column": "file"
          },
          {
            "column": "camera"
          },
          {
            "column": "source"
          },
          {
            "column": "session"
          }
        ],
        "metrics": [
          {
            "column": "photos"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
